{"step_index":1107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T14:22:04Z","thinking":"**Reviewing the Nginx configuration.**\n\nExamining the current configuration file reveals the server details.  Focusing on the configuration, to determine the necessary updates.  The analysis will guide the configuration modification process to ensure correct settings.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Nginx configuration.**\n\nThe configuration uses Let's Encrypt certificates for SSL and redirects root requests to a specific application path. A reverse proxy forwards traffic to a backend server over HTTPS on port 9443. Proxy headers are set for correct forwarding.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"/home/koby/.ansible/kssh th2-revproxyp-fe1 'cat << \"EOF\" | sudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf\n# HTTPS Centreon MAP\nserver {\n    listen              172.30.198.33:9443 ssl http2;\n    listen              109.62.64.18:9443 ssl http2;\n    server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr 109.62.64.18;\n\n    # SSL (certificat dédié Let'\\''s Encrypt)\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\n\n    # security\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\n\n    # logging\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\n\n    # Redirection explicite racine -> /centreon-map/\n    location = / {\n        return 301 /centreon-map/;\n    }\n\n    # reverse proxy vers Map (Tomcat HTTPS sur port 9443)\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;\n        proxy_ssl_verify           off;\n\n        # Protocol & keepalive\n        proxy_http_version         1.1;\n        proxy_cache_bypass         $http_upgrade;\n        proxy_set_header Upgrade   $http_upgrade;\n        proxy_set_header Connection $connection_upgrade;\n\n        # Proxy headers (single definition per header to comply with RFC 7230)\n        proxy_set_header Host              $http_host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP         $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For   $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl   on;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Host  $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Port  9443;\n\n        # Timeouts\n        proxy_connect_timeout      60s;\n        proxy_send_timeout         60s;\n        proxy_read_timeout         60s;\n\n        # CORS Support for Centreon Web AJAX (Port 9443 called from Web UI)\n        add_header '\\''Access-Control-Allow-Origin'\\'' '\\''*'\\'' always;\n        add_header '\\''Access-Control-Allow-Methods'\\'' '\\''GET, POST, OPTIONS, PUT, DELETE'\\'' always;\n        add_header '\\''Access-Control-Allow-Headers'\\'' '\\''DNT,User-Agent,X-Requested-With,If-Modified-Since,Cache-Control,Content-Type,Range,Authorization'\\'' always;\n        add_header '\\''Access-Control-Expose-Headers'\\'' '\\''Content-Length,Content-Range'\\'' always;\n\n        if ($request_method = '\\''OPTIONS'\\'') {\n            add_header '\\''Access-Control-Allow-Origin'\\'' '\\''*'\\'' always;\n            add_header '\\''Access-Control-Allow-Methods'\\'' '\\''GET, POST, OPTIONS, PUT, DELETE'\\'' always;\n            add_header '\\''Access-Control-Allow-Headers'\\'' '\\''DNT,User-Agent,X-Requested-With,If-Modified-Since,Cache-Control,Content-Type,Range,Authorization'\\'' always;\n            add_header '\\''Access-Control-Max-Age'\\'' 1728000;\n            add_header '\\''Content-Type'\\'' '\\''text/plain; charset=utf-8'\\'';\n            add_header '\\''Content-Length'\\'' 0;\n            return 204;\n        }\n\n        proxy_redirect             http:// https://;\n        proxy_headers_hash_max_size   1024;\n        proxy_headers_hash_bucket_size 128;\n    }\n\n    # additional config\n    include nginxconfig.io/general.conf;\n}\nEOF\nsudo nginx -t\n'","Cwd":"/home/koby","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Updating 03-map config and testing syntax","toolSummary":"Apply clean config and test nginx -t"}}]}
